(Barrier Latch) Tj T*
(Barrier Latch: admission succeeds only when two distinct peers confirm the same slot hash) Tj T*
(before tick 4.) Tj T*
(A confirmation from the same peer twice, or arriving at tick 4 or later, resets the latch.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
