(Cooldown Guard) Tj T*
(Cooldown Guard: after a reset, the sender pauses for 6 ticks before sending a fresh slot) Tj T*
(hash.) Tj T*
(Cooldown Guard only paces retries; it never opens barrier admission.) Tj T*
ET
